  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:13.630" end="00:16.090" ttm:agent="v1">Oh woah oh</p>
      <p begin="00:16.090" end="00:17.590" ttm:agent="v1">Oh</p>
      <p begin="00:17.450" end="00:20.140" ttm:agent="v1">Oh</p>
      <p begin="00:20.140" end="00:21.640" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:21.580" end="00:23.870" ttm:agent="v1">She's got rings covered in gold</p>
      <p begin="00:23.870" end="00:26.450" ttm:agent="v1">Fur coat and it's not even cold</p>
      <p begin="00:26.450" end="00:29.060" ttm:agent="v1">Thrifted from her head to toe</p>
      <p begin="00:29.060" end="00:31.460" ttm:agent="v1">She walks around like she's been here before</p>
      <p begin="00:31.460" end="00:33.850" ttm:agent="v1">I think of game even tho imma pro</p>
      <p begin="00:33.850" end="00:35.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(i see her glasses comment)</p>
      <p begin="00:35.370" end="00:37.720" ttm:agent="v1">My words they barely even do a thing</p>
      <p begin="00:37.720" end="00:40.690" ttm:agent="v1">I really thought that she was just the same</p>
      <p begin="00:40.690" end="00:43.240" ttm:agent="v1">Her friends all call her for advice</p>
      <p begin="00:43.240" end="00:45.750" ttm:agent="v1">And she puts her pride up for sacrifice</p>
      <p begin="00:45.750" end="00:48.450" ttm:agent="v1">And she works too hard needs paradise</p>
      <p begin="00:48.450" end="00:50.990" ttm:agent="v1">And im sure i can take you there every night</p>
      <p begin="00:50.990" end="00:54.040" ttm:agent="v1">I probably won't admit it but i am acquitted, addicted</p>
      <p begin="00:54.040" end="00:55.620" ttm:agent="v1">I pray you'll never</p>
      <p begin="00:55.620" end="00:57.950" ttm:agent="v1">I know that she will never feel the same</p>
      <p begin="00:57.950" end="00:59.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(no, oh, oh, oh)</p>
      <p begin="00:59.800" end="01:02.290" ttm:agent="v1">And she has composure</p>
      <p begin="01:02.290" end="01:04.680" ttm:agent="v1">Already controlled ya</p>
      <p begin="01:04.680" end="01:07.420" ttm:agent="v1">Im running in circles</p>
      <p begin="01:07.420" end="01:09.940" ttm:agent="v1">Come on just come closer</p>
      <p begin="01:09.940" end="01:12.430" ttm:agent="v1">You're my four leaf clover</p>
      <p begin="01:12.430" end="01:14.610" ttm:agent="v1">The temptations a grower</p>
      <p begin="01:14.610" end="01:17.290" ttm:agent="v1">But my heart is a shower</p>
      <p begin="01:17.290" end="01:20.820" ttm:agent="v1">Ill call you when im sober</p>
      <p begin="01:20.820" end="01:24.530" ttm:agent="v1">Now we're eskimo kissing the club</p>
      <p begin="01:24.530" end="01:26.270" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah i think im in love</p>
      <p begin="01:26.270" end="01:29.350" ttm:agent="v1">And our feelings start coming up</p>
      <p begin="01:29.350" end="01:31.130" ttm:agent="v1">She said that im the one</p>
      <p begin="01:31.130" end="01:33.430" ttm:agent="v1">Ill make sure you feel enough</p>
      <p begin="01:33.430" end="01:36.280" ttm:agent="v1">Pick you up when you feel stuck</p>
      <p begin="01:36.280" end="01:38.700" ttm:agent="v1">You're a blessing from above</p>
      <p begin="01:38.700" end="01:41.500" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah my luck is overdone</p>
      <p begin="01:41.500" end="01:44.130" ttm:agent="v1">You're not the one to judge</p>
      <p begin="01:44.130" end="01:46.660" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah you're noble and your fun</p>
      <p begin="01:46.660" end="01:49.170" ttm:agent="v1">And your hearts too big to grudge</p>
      <p begin="01:49.170" end="01:51.790" ttm:agent="v1">And i don't have time to bluff</p>
      <p begin="01:51.790" end="01:54.730" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah the night feels like it's never ending</p>
      <p begin="01:54.730" end="01:57.190" ttm:agent="v1">Eyes are locked and hearts are pounding</p>
      <p begin="01:57.190" end="01:59.880" ttm:agent="v1">Im latching onto you forever</p>
      <p begin="01:59.880" end="02:02.070" ttm:agent="v1">I can't do this on my own</p>
      <p begin="02:02.070" end="02:04.230" ttm:agent="v1">And she has composure</p>
      <p begin="02:04.230" end="02:06.430" ttm:agent="v1">Already controlled ya</p>
      <p begin="02:06.430" end="02:08.850" ttm:agent="v1">Im running in circles</p>
      <p begin="02:08.850" end="02:11.580" ttm:agent="v1">Come on just come closer</p>
      <p begin="02:11.580" end="02:13.860" ttm:agent="v1">You're my four leaf clover</p>
      <p begin="02:13.860" end="02:16.600" ttm:agent="v1">The temptations a grower</p>
      <p begin="02:16.600" end="02:19.080" ttm:agent="v1">But my heart is a shower</p>
      <p begin="02:19.080" end="02:22.040" ttm:agent="v1">Ill call you when im sober</p>
      <p begin="02:22.040" end="02:24.660" ttm:agent="v1">And she has composure</p>
      <p begin="02:24.660" end="02:27.200" ttm:agent="v1">Already controlled ya</p>
      <p begin="02:27.200" end="02:29.680" ttm:agent="v1">Im running in circles</p>
      <p begin="02:29.680" end="02:32.180" ttm:agent="v1">Come on just come closer</p>
      <p begin="02:32.180" end="02:34.610" ttm:agent="v1">You're my four leaf clover</p>
      <p begin="02:34.610" end="02:36.980" ttm:agent="v1">The temptations a grower</p>
      <p begin="02:36.980" end="02:39.600" ttm:agent="v1">But my heart is a shower</p>
      <p begin="02:39.600" end="02:44.550" ttm:agent="v1">Ill call you when im sober</p>
      <p begin="02:44.550" end="02:50.540" ttm:agent="v1">I'll call you when im sober</p>
